# Keep LF line endings in the working tree on every platform (Windows CI
# runners default to core.autocrlf=true), matching .editorconfig and rustfmt.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary data: recordings and imported assets must never be converted.
*.drf binary
*.edrf binary
*.png binary
*.wav binary
*.bin binary
*.zz binary
*.rgba binary

# The upstream recording corpus is stored byte-for-byte (one file has CR LF
# line ends) so that tests/recordings/MANIFEST.sha256 stays valid everywhere.
tests/recordings/** -text
